<file path="extraction-service/README.md">
# Marker Extraction Service

Python microservice that extracts text and LaTeX math notation from PDFs using Marker.

## Setup

```powershell
task setup
```

This creates the virtual environment and installs dependencies.

## Commands

All commands are run from the project root via Task:

```powershell
task start-pix2text    # Start service on port 8080
task stop-pix2text     # Stop service
task restart-pix2text  # Restart service
task status-pix2text   # Check if running
```

## API

```
POST http://localhost:8080/extract/pdf
Content-Type: application/pdf

Response:
{
  "filename": "book.pdf",
  "pages": 10,
  "chunks": [
    {"page": 1, "text": "..."},
    ...
  ]
}
```

## Configuration

| Property | Default | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `app.extraction.mode` | `pix2text` | Set to `pix2text` to use this service |
| `app.extraction.pix2text.url` | `http://localhost:8080` | Extraction service URL |
| `app.extraction.pix2text.timeout` | `600s` | Request timeout |
</file>

